---
/*
==========================================================
SEDS — Privacy Policy
Purpose: Explains how Support Engineering Blog handles
visitor information and third-party services.
==========================================================
*/

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/layout/Container.astro";
import Section from "../components/layout/Section.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="Privacy Policy for Support Engineering Blog."
>

    <main id="main-content" class="legal-page">

        <Section>

            <Container>

                <article class="legal-content">

                    <header class="legal-header">

                        <p class="legal-header__eyebrow">
                            LEGAL
                        </p>

                        <h1>
                            Privacy Policy
                        </h1>

                        <p>
                            Last updated: August 9, 2026
                        </p>

                    </header>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Privacy at a Glance
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            Support Engineering Blog ("SEB", "we", "us",
                            or "our") is a technical publication focused
                            on Microsoft technologies, administration,
                            troubleshooting, and support engineering.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We aim to keep the site useful without
                            collecting more information than is reasonably
                            necessary. We do not currently operate a
                            newsletter, user account system, advertising
                            platform, or contact form.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We use Google Analytics to understand how
                            visitors use the site and to improve its
                            content and structure. We also use Google
                            Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools to
                            understand how the site is discovered,
                            crawled, indexed, and presented in search
                            results.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Information We Collect
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            SEB does not ask visitors to create accounts
                            or provide personal information simply to
                            read articles.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Depending on how you interact with the site
                            and your browser settings, technical and
                            usage information may be processed through
                            services used to operate and understand the
                            website. This may include information such as
                            pages viewed, approximate geographic location,
                            browser and device information, and session
                            information.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            We do not intentionally request or collect
                            sensitive personal information through the
                            website.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Google Analytics
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            SEB uses Google Analytics to understand
                            aggregate patterns in website usage. This
                            helps us understand which articles are useful,
                            how visitors discover the site, and how the
                            site's structure can be improved.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Google Analytics may process information such
                            as user and session statistics, approximate
                            geographic information, and browser or device
                            information. Google Analytics may also use
                            first-party cookies and similar identifiers
                            when analytics storage is permitted.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            SEB does not intentionally send personally
                            identifiable information to Google Analytics.
                            We also do not use Google Analytics to create
                            user accounts or ask visitors to provide
                            personal information.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Analytics is configured with privacy in mind,
                            and visitors may decline analytics through
                            the site's consent controls where applicable.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            For more information about how Google handles
                            data collected through Analytics, please see
                            Google's
                            <a
                                href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            >
                                Privacy Policy
                            </a>.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Cookies and Local Storage
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            SEB may use browser storage and cookies to
                            support website functionality and optional
                            analytics.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The site's theme preference may be stored
                            locally in your browser so that SEB can
                            remember whether you prefer light or dark
                            mode. This preference is not used to identify
                            you or track your activity across websites.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Google Analytics may use first-party cookies
                            when analytics storage has been permitted.
                            You can control cookies and browser storage
                            through your browser settings.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Google Search Console
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            Google Search Console is used by SEB as a
                            website-owner and search-performance tool.
                            It helps us understand how pages from the
                            site appear in Google Search, including
                            information such as search impressions,
                            clicks, queries, and indexing status.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Search Console is used to improve the
                            discoverability and technical health of the
                            website. It is not used by SEB as a visitor
                            account or authentication system.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Bing Webmaster Tools
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            SEB uses Bing Webmaster Tools to monitor the
                            site's presence in Bing search and to
                            understand crawling, indexing, search
                            performance, and technical SEO issues.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            These tools are used by the site owner to
                            maintain and improve SEB. They do not require
                            visitors to create an account with SEB.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            External Links and References
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            Articles published on SEB may contain links
                            to Microsoft documentation, GitHub,
                            third-party documentation, research,
                            community resources, and other external
                            websites.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Once you leave SEB, the privacy practices of
                            the destination website apply. We encourage
                            you to review the privacy policies of external
                            services before providing them with personal
                            information.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Data Retention
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            SEB does not maintain a visitor account
                            database or newsletter subscriber database.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Information processed by third-party services
                            such as Google Analytics, Google Search
                            Console, and Bing Webmaster Tools is subject
                            to the respective service's policies,
                            retention settings, and terms.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Your Choices
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            You can control cookies and browser storage
                            through your browser settings. Where
                            analytics consent controls are provided, you
                            can choose whether optional analytics
                            measurement is enabled.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            You may also contact us if you have questions
                            about how information relating to your use of
                            SEB is handled.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Changes to This Policy
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            This Privacy Policy may be updated when the
                            website, its features, or the services used
                            to operate it change.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            The "Last updated" date at the beginning of
                            this page indicates when the policy was most
                            recently revised.
                        </p>

                    </section>


                    <section>

                        <h2>
                            Contact
                        </h2>

                        <p>
                            If you have questions about this Privacy
                            Policy or the way SEB handles information,
                            contact:
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            <a href="mailto:contact@sadhan.ch">
                                contact@sadhan.ch
                            </a>
                        </p>

                    </section>

                </article>

            </Container>

        </Section>

    </main>

</BaseLayout>